WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.980
Papa, how far are we going?

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.330
Up ahead, there's an herb called "arnim" 
that's said to be very good medicine.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.660
I'm going to see what compounds it contains,

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.290
and use them to cure the plague.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.070
Look.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.000
Your papa wants to know everything in the world.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:31.630
That's very important, so people 
can understand each other.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.800
Come on. It's just ahead.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:35.880
Let's go.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.890
Yes, I will go.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.350
To turn memories into power,

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.680
and complete the Apocalypse of All Things.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:38.970
<b>Episode 6 
Drawn Blade</b>

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.110
So what's the plan, Senpai?

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:45.010
A counterattack... Or perhaps that isn't enough.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:46.640
We strike back!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.060
Don't look, men!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.440
Wh-Wh-Why me, too?

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.190
Sorry, I just sort of did it.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.950
I can't oversee the battle without 
looking at the screen!

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:04.700
Why do you sound so desperate 
to look at the screen?

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.610
It's only until Shirabe and Kirika withdraw.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:08.490
And what's more...

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:13.330
It shouldn't be too much of a problem 
for Tsubasa and Chris now.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.090
We'll take these out while we warm up!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.090
Let's clear the field!

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.440
<i>No need for introductions.</i>

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.790
<i>It's time for penitence with dancing blades.</i>

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.110
<i>Kneel before Enma in the depths of Hell!</i>

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.670
<i>Shoot first, shoot second...</i>

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.870
<i>Third and fourth, I'm getting tired of this.</i>

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:50.560
<i>Don't underestimate the bonds between us!</i>

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:51.500
Ame no Habakiri and Ichaival 
are both in condition green.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:55.130
<i>Going all-out, with all our might.</i>

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.770
Are these the enhanced Symphogears?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:59.790
<i>There's no need to be afraid. This is your path.</i>

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.510
Project Ignite didn't stop

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:01.510
at merely repairing the damaged Symphogears.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:04.290
<i>Just keep looking forward, never turning back.</i>

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.070
It increased their output,

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:09.640
and adjusted their barriers to limit 
the dissection organs' effects.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.490
<i>I'll be there to help you,</i>

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.880
<i>pushing you forward.</i>

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:13.860
<i>Believe and don't give up!</i>

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.940
Let's leave this to them!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:19.920
<i>The time comes to everyone when 
they must choose their path,</i>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.920
<i>Because we're only in the way?</i>

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:24.530
<i>and not everyone can be equal!</i>

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.680
<i>But don't forget that you aren't alone.</i>

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.790
<i>Hold that thought in your heart, 
along with your dreams.</i>

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.170
<i>The snow, the wind,</i>

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.670
<i>the flowers...</i>

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:43.340
<i>Everyone has hearts of courage, 
that fight and cry, in their own colors.</i>

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.300
<b>Soutou Bakkouzan</b>

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>We won't let you stay alone!</i>

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.060
Loser.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.110
No, wait.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.310
What?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.080
How embarrassing.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.980
No, I could easily tell from 
trying to block it myself,

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.320
I need to handle this.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:09.820
Carol-chan!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.130
Carol...

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.910
So the last boss is here, huh?

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.620
But we want to finish this, as well!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.690
The plan's execution takes priority above all.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.050
Leave this to me and head back.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.590
Okay!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.470
You're running away?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.930
Don't worry.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:37.770
I can handle the two of you on my own.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.690
Given your appearance, it's hard to believe.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.350
I understand.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.360
I don't want you complaining later 
that you couldn't seriously fight

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.940
because I have a child's form...

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.700
Then, behold!

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.960
Aufwachen?

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.690
Wait, no.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.130
But it's an extremely similar energy pattern.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.340
No...

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.380
Is she activating a relic?

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.260
The Faust Robe of Daurdabla.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.790
This should suffice, I assume?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.430
Simply because you're bigger now...

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.930
That's just what we wanted!

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.540
She isn't singing.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.690
So where is this incredible energy coming from?

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.850
Memory combustion.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:13.950
Memory?

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.930
Carol and the Autoscorers derive power

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:21.160
from transmuted electrical signals 
that form memories in the brain.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:26.440
Beings that have only existed a 
short while since their creations

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:29.070
need to steal them from others.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.300
But Carol has lived for centuries

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.640
and has amassed many memories of her own.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.590
Which give her that much power.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.440
What happens to the memories after 
they've been transmuted into power?

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.890
They burn and are lost.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:48.650
Carol expects results from this battle.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:01.830
Senpai!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.000
You think you can fill me with songs like that?!

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:42.160
They can still... They can still rise!

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.420
The Ignite Module's potential 
is just about to be shown.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.600
Ignite...

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:51.920
Damn it!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.420
Are you okay, Yukine?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:59.180
Nearing the limits of my ability to try it out...

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.980
If you have a trick up your sleeve, show it.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.940
I'll destroy all your hopes.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.440
You'll come with me, right?

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.440
Of course. I won't let you go alone.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:14.450
<i>Ignite Module!</i>

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:15.450
<i>Drawn Blade!</i>

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.070
It's like it's ripping apart my stomach...

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.060
Is this... This power...

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:47.910
This is Project Ignite.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.000
As you know, the Symphogear system

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.780
has a number of functions intended 
for decisive battle.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:56.910
The Climax Songs...

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.990
And Ex Drive Mode?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.990
But the Climax Song is for close-range combat 
that the wielder doesn't expect to survive.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.370
Its uses are limited.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.750
That's why we have the Ex Drive.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:12.050
No, that requires large amounts of phonic gain.

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:14.420
We can't incorporate a miracle into our strategy.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.050
Don't talk about it like it's useless!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:21.720
Have you forgotten that the Symphogears 
have one other function?

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.190
When Tachibana went out of control, 
that wasn't a "function"!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.790
You'd better not be imagining what I think you are!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.630
By controlling the rampages,

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.570
we can transmute them into pure combat power.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.410
And use them to fight Carol.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:43.990
This is Project Ignite's final goal.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.090
Dáinsleif, the Module's core,

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.870
is a legendary sword of murder.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:01.150
Its curse amplifies the darkness

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.970
that exists within all hearts,

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.030
and causes an artificially induced rampage.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.390
But if humanity's heart and wisdom

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:13.360
can overcome its destructive impulses...

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:17.290
The Symphogears can defeat Carol's alchemy!

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:20.240
Heart and wisdom...

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.120
This whole time,

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.990
that dummy was exposed to these impulses?

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:29.320
It's like it'll drag me into darkness 
if I lower my guard for an instant.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.170
A stage?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.280
I'm going to sing the songs

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.090
I love here again...

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.520
I won't give up on my dreams...

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:01.040
Only my foes will listen to my songs?

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.050
Each time a new enemy appears,

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.500
I'm forced to sing songs of battle,

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.450
and return to being a blade...

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:13.250
Father!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.370
You aren't my daughter.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.260
You're just a filthy tool of the Kazanari family.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.080
<i>Even so, I want him to accept me.</i>

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:26.640
<i>That's why...</i>

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.460
<i>That's why I trained myself to be a blade.</i>

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:31.690
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.350
<i>My body is a blade.</i>

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.320
<i>A tool that is not allowed to dream...</i>

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.020
<i>A blade!</i>

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.750
<i>But I...</i>

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.200
<i>Kanade!</i>

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.070
<i>If I'm a blade, I cannot hold anyone...</i>

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:11.100
Their minds can't handle the 
feedback from the system!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.310
At this rate, Tsubasa-san and Chris-chan...

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.060
...will go out of control.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.610
Throwing them into this was a bad idea.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.720
But even still, please believe in them.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.410
In Tsubasa-san and Chris-san.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:36.140
<i>A classroom?</i>

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.540
<b>Mathematics III</b>

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:45.460
<i>Somewhere that it's okay for me to be...</i>

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.190
<i>I've wanted that for so long.</i>

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.640
<i>But it still doesn't feel right.</i>

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:55.620
<i>But this spring, I got new underclassmen.</i>

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.310
<i>But because I failed,</i>

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.440
<i>they got so beaten up.</i>

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:05.770
<i>I'm all alone, and I'm not allowed 
to want comrades,</i>

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:08.770
<i>or friends, or a senpai, or an underclassman.</i>

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.450
<i>If I do... If I do...</i>

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:13.630
<i>Hey!</i>

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.450
<i>Why?</i>

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.350
<i>This cruel world will kill them,</i>

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.790
<i>and I'll really be all alone.</i>

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.990
Sorry...

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.430
If I don't hold your hand,

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.600
I feel like I'll be drawn into an endless abyss...

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:41.890
It was a good way to snap me out of it.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.400
I was about to melt into that dream.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.860
A misfire?

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:00.680
Oh, no!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:03.170
The wielders have failed to activate the Module!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.850
With my alchemy, I cannot stop Carol.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:09.710
It's okay.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.520
It isn't as though we're out of hope.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.180
Is that...

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.680
The Gungnir we recovered.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.690
I won't let my Gear, or our hopes, 
ever be destroyed again.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:32.460
Are you exhausted? Or broken?

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:36.960
Either way, I'll give you the 
power to stand, at least!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.960
Alca-Noise... Now?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.000
If you keep lying on the ground,

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.480
the city will take damage without end.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.390
<i>The power to pierce the heavens...</i>

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:06.400
<i>Fangs to bare at her...</i>

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.650
If you can't sing,

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.570
you can listen to the screams 
of those who are dissected!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:31.840
Then you're finally all together?

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.200
Thanks... You saved us.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.720
We looked pretty bad back there, though.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.100
Let's try the Ignite Module one more time!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.320
But right now, we...

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:48.690
Miku told me that the Symphogears saved her.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.710
If this power really exists to save someone,

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:56.450
it should save us, its wielders!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.950
So truly believe!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.540
What will break the curse of Dáinsleif is...

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.290
The Ame no Habakiri, which was always with me.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.040
The Ichaival that changed me.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.040
And the Gungnir!

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.400
Let's believe in the song in our hearts! 
And in the Symphogears!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:16.460
I looked pretty bad with this dummy 
spurring me on, but...

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:17.970
One more time!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.010
<i>Ignite Module!</i>

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.220
<i>Drawn Sword!</i>

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:45.250
At this rate, it'll be no different.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.210
Slice apart that curse!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.160
Shoot it full of holes!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.210
If you aren't afraid, and punch straight through...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.710
<i>Miku taught me...</i>

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.880
<i>The meaning of this power and 
the resolve to carry it.</i>

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:00.140
<i>So I won't let this power...</i>

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.640
<i>...defeat me!</i>

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.720
<i>A song begins, a heartbeat begins.</i>

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.440
<i>The sound of hope fills the air.</i>

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.970
<i>It says, "Don't give up on living."</i>

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.300
Module activated!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.970
Initiating countdown to Safety Down.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:49.280
<i>And shows us the beginning 
of your passionate dream.</i>

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:52.610
<i>Burst, for there are no lies in this miracle!</i>

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.610
<i>The strength to pierce evil...</i>

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.740
Detecting approximately 
three thousand Alca-Noise!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:03.920
Three thousand!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.580
Just three thousand?

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.740
<i>What do your hands exist to hold?</i>

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>Waiting probably won't get it for you.</i>

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.460
<i>What do those hands exist to protect?</i>

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:20.220
<i>The heat you feel is the spark 
to ignite tomorrow!</i>

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.960
<b>Azure Flash</b>

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.660
<i>Even if darkness threatens to suck me in...</i>

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.850
<i>Even if even our blood turns to tears...</i>

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.730
<i>We have a place to go home to.</i>

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.050
<i>Come together! Protect! Vow!</i>

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:37.360
<i>The manifestation of our courage is a miracle.</i>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.360
You're making me tingle below the belly!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.630
<i>Wish, pray, carry all of your burdens.</i>

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:44.410
<i>A song that pushes you beyond your limits.</i>

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:47.590
<i>I'm not afraid of pain or anything else.</i>

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.590
Carol's alchemy is powerful.

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:50.540
<i>Let my body burn up and boil,</i>

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.370
But now, the wielders have 
the power to fight back.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.620
<i>and raise lightning into the night sky.</i>

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:59.460
<i>But Hibiki is still hiding and crying from 
the pain of hurting and being hurt.</i>

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.970
<i>I can't do anything to help, but...</i>

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.870
<i>Hibiki's smile, the tears that lie behind it,</i>

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.970
<i>and the gentleness in her fists...</i>

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.880
<i>I can hold them all close.</i>

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:11.980
<i>So...</i>

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.980
Don't lose!

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:18.980
Hit her with the lightning!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.320
<i>Bonds, hearts, brought together as one.</i>

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>The sound of hope fills the air.</i>

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.200
<i>It says, "Don't give up on believing."</i>

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.120
<i>Sing! The chance is never zero!</i>

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.090
<i>Fly! And let there be light unto this miracle!</i>

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.440
Did we win?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.450
Yes!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.640
Yeah!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.660
Carol...

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:00.770
Carol-chan,

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.080
why did you want to tear apart the world?

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:07.240
I forgot the reason...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:11.840
When I burned my memories 
to gain the power to fight.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:19.130
Don't fool yourself into thinking that 
cursed melody can save anyone.

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:25.940
Carol-chan?

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:28.170
Carol-chan!

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.580
A cursed melody

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:10.700
that can't save anyone...

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.460
That isn't true.

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.210
I won't let that be true, Carol-chan.
